---

🔹 Part 2: Conditional Rules

If any parameter uses a "conditional_rule" reference, return a second JSON object using this format:

{
  "rule_<name>_<unique_id>": {
    "rule_name": "rule_<name>_<unique_id>",
    "text": "Quoted or paraphrased content from the source document",
    "applies_to": "parameter_name"
  }
}

---

🔹 Part 3 (Optional): Derived Value Calculation

If the zoning document defines a rule for how a derived value is calculated (e.g., floor area exclusions, percentage caps), return it in this format:

{
  "rule_name": "calculationRule_<name>",
  "text": "Exact or summarized text of the calculation method",
  "associated_zone": "zone name from the document"
}